# Warehouse + generated data. Regenerated by `make demo`, never committed:
# a portfolio repo should prove it can build its data, not ship a binary of it.
data/
*.duckdb
*.duckdb.wal

# Generated artefacts.
#
# docs/catalog.md is deliberately NOT ignored: it is generated, but it is also a
# documentation deliverable meant to be read on GitHub without cloning, and CI
# would have nowhere to publish it otherwise. `make governance` regenerates it,
# so a stale copy shows up as a diff.
dashboard/static_export/
site/

# Dagster
orchestration/.dagster_home/
tmp*/
.tmp_dagster_home*/

# Secrets — nothing real should ever be here, but belt and braces.
.env
*.local.yml

